            "tone": "good",
            "text": "Nonsense-variant DMD muscle: <3% dystrophin by Western blot",
            "cite": "Hoffman 1988"
          },
          {
            "tone": "good",
            "text": "Ataluren (Translarna) promotes ribosomal readthrough of PTC codons → partial rescue",
            "cite": "Bushby 2014"
          },
